  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div>
        <tei:pb ed="1965" n="3" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n8_medium.jpg"/>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="15"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="37" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/37"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/37" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n8_medium.jpg">Thus spoke the Lord to Moses:</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" n="38" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/38"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/38" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n8_medium.jpg">Speak to the children of Israel and tell them to make themselves show-fringes upon the corners of their garments throughout their generations and to fasten to the fringe of each corner a thread of skyblue wool.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" n="39" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/39"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/39" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n8_medium.jpg">They shall be show-fringes to you so that when you look upon them, you will remember all the<tei:pb ed="1965" n="4" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n10_medium.jpg"/> commandments of the Lord and fulfil them. And do not follow your heart and your eyes after which you go astray.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" n="40" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/40"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/40" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n10_medium.jpg">Thus may you remember and fulfil all my commandments and be holy unto your God.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" n="41" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/41"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/41" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n10_medium.jpg">I am the Lord your God who led you out of the land of Egypt in order to be your God. I am the Lord your God.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
